<title>USA: Renaissance OKs 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Renaissance OKs 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renaissance Entertainment Corp said Tuesday it approved a two-for-one forward common stock split, including its A and B warrants, in the form of a stock dividend, payable to shareholders of record as of October 17.</p>
<p>The company said the new shares will be distributed on October 21. The stock split will increase the company's shares outstanding to about 10 million, the company said.</p>
